UPDATE companies SET description='Archbold Furniture has operated in Archbold, Ohio since 1900. The company is led by owner and president Pat McNamara. It began as a solid wood furniture maker and now operates three brands — Archbold Furniture, Amish Essentials, and Bob Timberlake® American Home — from its Northwest Ohio location.

The manufacturer produces solid wood furniture for every room, including bedroom, dining, living room, home office, bookcases, and kitchen storage. Construction uses select solid woods such as alder and maple, with English dovetail drawers and smooth glides. Finishes are applied by Amish craftsmen using a catalyzed conversion varnish that resists moisture, heat, and scratches, with color options matched to each wood species.

Pat McNamara states the business is dedicated to quality furniture backed by extraordinary service at a value, with a commitment to continuous improvement. Core values rooted in Christian principles — family first, integrity, embracing adversity, setting others up to succeed, and respecting the process — guide operations and customer relationships.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solid wood furniture manufacturing", "English dovetail joinery", "Custom finish application (catalyzed conversion varnish)", "Amish handcrafted finishing", "Furniture assembly and hardware installation", "Dealer program management", "Showroom and virtual tour presentation"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Home furnishings", "Furniture retail (dealer network)", "Interior design"], "materials": ["Alder", "Maple", "Hardwoods", "Solid wood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom Amish finishes applied by Amish craftsmen using catalyzed conversion varnish", "English dovetail drawer construction with smooth glides", "Solid wood construction (solid tops, sides, and drawer parts)", "Three distinct brands under one company: Archbold Furniture, Amish Essentials, Bob Timberlake\u00ae American Home", "Dealer support including High Point showroom, virtual tours, and downloadable resources"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1900 in Archbold, Ohio -> db", "Owner/President Pat McNamara -> /", "Three brands: Archbold Furniture, Amish Essentials, Bob Timberlake\u00ae American Home -> /", "Solid wood furniture with English dovetail drawers and smooth glides -> /", "Custom Amish finishes with catalyzed conversion varnish resistant to moisture, heat, scratches -> /", "Dealer network with High Point showroom and virtual tours -> /", "Core values: Christian principles, Family First, Integrity, etc. -> /", "Materials: alder, maple, hardwoods -> /", "Headquarters: Archbold, Ohio -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products