UPDATE companies SET description='Arctic Restaurant Service & Supply was founded in 1973 in Madisonville, Kentucky, as a family-owned business serving the western Kentucky region. The company has operated continuously for over five decades, building a reputation as a local supplier and service provider for commercial foodservice operations.

The company distributes commercial cooking equipment, refrigeration systems, and restaurant supplies from brands such as Vulcan, Duke, Blodgett, Henny Penny, True Manufacturing, Victory Refrigeration, and Delfield. In addition to sales, Arctic provides refrigeration service and installation, commercial HVAC services, planned maintenance programs, emergency repair available 24/7, parts and accessories with special orders typically arriving in three to four business days, and refrigerated trailer rentals with free delivery within a 60-mile radius. Its technicians are factory-trained, licensed, and insured.

Arctic serves a range of foodservice establishments, from small cafes to large commercial kitchens. Its customer base includes restaurants, hotels, schools, healthcare facilities, and other institutional kitchens across western Kentucky and surrounding areas. The company also supports nontraditional operations such as catering through its trailer rental program.

Arctic differentiates itself as an authorized warranty provider for major brands, offering factory-trained service technicians and 24/7 emergency response. Its family-owned, locally operated structure allows for personalized service, while membership in the ISC Buying Group and CFESA Trade Association provides access to national pricing and industry standards. The company emphasizes fast delivery, in-store pickup, and preventative maintenance plans tailored to each client’s equipment.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Refrigeration service and installation", "Commercial HVAC services", "Planned maintenance programs", "Delivery and in-store pickup", "Emergency repair services (24/7)", "Parts and accessories supply", "Refrigerated trailer rentals", "Restaurant supply sales", "Commercial cooking equipment sales", "Commercial refrigeration equipment sales", "Special orders (3-4 business days)", "Warranty service for major brands"], "industries": ["Restaurants", "Hotels", "Schools", "Healthcare facilities", "Food service establishments", "Cafes", "Commercial kitchens", "Catering"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Refrigerated trailers"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Special orders arrive within 3-4 business days", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Authorized warranty provider for major brands", "Factory-trained, licensed, and insured service technicians", "24/7 emergency repair service", "Free delivery within 60 miles on refrigerated trailer rentals", "Preventative maintenance plans customized to equipment"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1973 -> db", "Headquarters Madisonville, Kentucky -> db", "Family-owned business -> /", "Small business -> /about", "Authorized warranty providers for major brands -> /", "Factory-trained service technicians -> /", "Licensed and insured -> /", "24/7 emergency services -> /", "Free delivery within 60 miles on refrigerated trailers -> /", "Special orders arrive within 3-4 business days -> /", "Brands carried (Vulcan, Duke, Blodgett, Henny Penny, True Manufacturing, Victory Refrigeration, Delfield, etc.) -> /about", "Associations: ISC Buying Group, CFESA Trade Association -> /about", "Industries served: restaurants, hotels, schools, healthcare facilities, cafes, commercial kitchens -> /", "Services: refrigeration service/installation, commercial HVAC, planned maintenance, delivery, in-store pickup, emergency services, parts & accessories, refrigerated trailer rentals, restaurant supply sales -> /about", "Languages: English -> /about", "License HM06616 -> /about"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We''re not just another restaurant supply store; we''re a family-owned business with over 50 years of experience.", "founded_year": "1973", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": ["English"], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned", "Small business"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='arctic-restaurant-service-supply' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Arizona Automotive Equipment, also known as Mohawk Automotive Lifts Southwest, has been based in Phoenix, Arizona since its founding in 2004. The company was started by Mike and Karen Green with a focus on annual lift safety inspections and detailed reporting to help customers meet OSHA requirements. In January 2021, ownership transferred to Jason and Brandi Byers, a husband-and-wife team who continue the family-run operation.

The business sells heavy-duty automotive lifts and equipment for both commercial shops and personal garages. Its product lineup includes two-post, four-post, mobile column, scissor, and specialty lifts from brands such as Mohawk Lifts, Hunter Engineering, Challenger Lifts, Tuxedo Lifts, and Samson. In addition to sales, the company provides ALI-certified lift inspections and in-house installation services performed by its own technicians, covering everything from single lifts to multi-lift shop projects across the Southwest region.

The company serves the broader automotive lift and equipment industry, with a particular emphasis on safety compliance and proper maintenance for lifts of any manufacturer, brand, or age.

The company highlights its ALI-certified lifts and inspectors, a comprehensive catalog of major brands, a 100% satisfaction guarantee, and personalized service from a local, family-owned team as key differentiators. Its original mission was to provide reliable annual inspections that keep lifts safe and businesses OSHA-compliant.', certifications=ARRAY['ALI Certified Lift Inspector','ALI Certified Lifts']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Automotive lift sales", "ALI-certified lift inspections", "Lift installation", "OSHA compliance reporting", "Equipment consultation"], "industries": ["Automotive repair and maintenance", "Commercial vehicle service", "Personal garage equipment"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Mohawk Lifts", "Hunter Engineering", "Challenger Lifts", "Tuxedo Lifts", "Samson"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ALI-certified lifts and inspectors", "In-house installation technicians", "Comprehensive catalog of major lift brands", "100% satisfaction guarantee", "Family-owned with personalized service"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2004 by Mike and Karen Green -> /about", "Owned by Jason and Brandi Byers since January 2021 -> /about", "Family-run operation -> /", "Location: Phoenix, Arizona -> /", "Sells heavy-duty automotive lifts and equipment -> /", "Brands: Mohawk, Hunter, Challenger, Tuxedo, Samson -> /", "Lift types: two-post, four-post, mobile column, scissor, specialty -> /", "ALI-certified lift inspections -> /", "In-house installation technicians -> /", "Serves commercial shops and personal garages -> /", "Serves Southwest region -> /", "ALI Certified Lifts and Inspectors as differentiators -> /", "100% satisfaction guarantee -> /", "Personalized service -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Arizona Automotive Equipment, LLC sells heavy-duty automotive lifts and equipment for commercial shops and personal garages, and provides ALI-certified lift inspections.", "founded_year": "2004", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='arizona-automotive-equipment' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Arizona Fabrication Solutions was founded in 2013 in Queen Creek, Arizona, as a veteran family-owned and operated metal fabrication business. The company was started by Shannon Miazga, an Army veteran with over 12 years of leadership experience and 13 years in production management, together with Bobby Padilla, an Arizona native.

The shop focuses on custom architectural and structural steel fabrication for residential and commercial construction projects across Arizona. Its services include fabricating and installing stair railings, gates, and a range of metal ornamentals such as indoor furniture and outdoor trellises.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Architectural steel fabrication", "Structural steel fabrication", "Stair railing fabrication", "Gate fabrication", "Custom metal ornamental fabrication"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction"], "materials": ["Structural steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Veteran family-owned and operated", "Specializes in custom architectural and structural steel fabrication", "Serves residential and commercial construction across Arizona", "Offers custom metal ornamentals including indoor furniture and outdoor trellises", "Founded by an Army veteran with extensive production management experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2013 -> db", "Headquartered in Queen Creek, Arizona -> db", "Veteran family-owned and operated -> db", "Founders: Shannon Miazga (Army veteran) and Bobby Padilla -> /about", "Shannon Miazga has 12+ years leadership experience and 13+ years production management -> /about", "Bobby Padilla is an Arizona native -> /about", "Specializes in custom architectural and structural steel fabrication -> /", "Services: stair railings, gates, custom metal ornamentals (indoor furniture, outdoor trellis) -> /", "Serves residential and commercial construction throughout Arizona -> /", "Company describes itself as a metal fabrication contractor -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We are a metal fabrication contractor specializing in custom architectural and structural steel for residential and commercial construction throughout the state of Arizona.", "founded_year": "2013", "e