UPDATE companies SET description='Arizona Mobile Meat Processing operates from Williams, Arizona, where founder Jake Giles launched the business in 2009 after two decades of cutting meat. Giles, the owner and operator, began with a mobile processing unit designed to travel to ranches and homes throughout northern Arizona, offering on-site slaughter and fabrication for domestic livestock.

The operation includes a mobile unit equipped for on-farm harvest, cutting, and wrapping, and the company also runs a separate retail butcher shop, Jake''s Butcher Shop, in the same area.

