UPDATE companies SET description='Arkansas Catering by Chef Wayne Schilleci operates from Cabot, Arkansas, and has served Central Arkansas since 2003. The business was founded by Chef Wayne Schilleci, who brought decades of restaurant ownership and operation experience into a catering model focused on chef-driven menus and full-service execution.

