UPDATE companies SET description='Solutions Fabricating Inc., a family-owned metal fabrication shop, operates from Glen Burnie, Maryland. The business traces its roots to 1996 when it was founded as Arundel Metal Products, initially producing custom sheet metal components for the mechanical HVAC industry. Over the years, the company expanded its capabilities and rebranded to Solutions Fabricating Inc. to reflect a broader manufacturing scope.

Today the shop functions as both a job shop and an original equipment manufacturer, delivering custom fabricated parts and assemblies. Core processes include CNC plasma and waterjet cutting, CNC bending and folding, light machining (milling and turning), braking, rolling, shearing, saw cutting, punching, notching, and welding of aluminum, steel, and stainless steel. The product line centers on roof curbs, unit curb adapters, equipment rails, fan curb adapters, grease ducts, and custom HVAC curbs, with CAD modeling support for design translation.

The customer base spans commercial construction, green energy (including daylighting and solar electric products), government projects, and the original HVAC sector. The company emphasizes its ability to serve clients who may be unfamiliar with fabrication, offering guidance from concept through production.

