UPDATE companies SET description='Atelier Amelia is a garment manufacturer based in New York, New York, founded in 2016 by designer Zhu Ru Chen. After struggling to find reliable manufacturers for her own swimwear line, Chen established the company to provide high-quality production with a personal touch for emerging brands.

