UPDATE companies SET description='Automated Food Systems is based in Waxahachie, Texas, and was founded in 1976 by mechanical engineer Glenn Walser with a single investor. The company began when a food processor needed a way to automate corn dog production — a challenge others said could not be solved — and Walser developed the world’s first automated corndog system.

Today the company designs, manufactures, and integrates custom food processing and material handling equipment for stick and skewered foods. Its product line includes corn dog systems running at 3,000 to 16,000 units per hour, kebab and skewer systems up to 4,080 units per hour, funnel cake systems, industrial batter mixers (60 to 180 gallon capacities), food pumps rated to 223 GPM, and food‑grade skewers and sticks. A history of over 20 distinct machine models — from the early PRL‑400 semi‑automated system to the KW‑2001 high‑speed skewering system — shows a deep, iterative engineering focus.

Customers range from small producers to the largest multi‑national food processing companies worldwide. Installations operate in plants across North America, South America, Africa, Europe, Asia, and Australia, serving the industrial food manufacturing, stick and skewered food, and concession sectors.

The company emphasizes problem‑solving for unique food automation challenges, citing its 40‑plus years of experience, custom design flexibility, and a service model that includes dedicated parts inventory, lifetime support, on‑site training during startup, and plant layout optimization. It positions itself as a partner that treats every customer as if it had a million competitors.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom design & fabrication", "Corn dog system manufacturing", "Kebab & skewer system manufacturing", "Funnel cake system manufacturing", "Industrial batter mixing", "Food pumping systems", "Food-grade skewer and stick supply", "Maintenance assistance", "Training & consultation", "Plant layout optimization"], "industries": ["Food processing", "Stick and skewered food", "Industrial food manufacturing", "Concessions"], "materials": ["Food-grade skewers", "Food-grade sticks", "Food-grade materials", "Batter", "Food pump components"], "equipment": ["PRL-400 Semi-Automated Corn Dog Processing System", "Model 123 Sanitary Food Transfer Pump", "MM-240 Five-Sack Batter Mixer", "PTL-1200 Semi-Automated Corn Dog System", "HOP-1300 Semi-Automated Corn Dog System", "PTL-1000 Semi-Automated Corn Dog System", "MM Jr. One Sack Mixer", "PTL-2000 Fully Automated Corn Dog System", "Model 200 Sanitary Food Pump", "PTL-2100 Fully Automated Corn Dog System", "SS-100 Sausage Sticking System", "MM-500 Ten Sack Batter Mixer", "HOP-100 Manual Corn Dog System", "HM-5 Table Top Market-Entry Mixer", "CD-3 Table Top Corn Dog System", "CD-3 Vendor Cart", "PTL 2600 Fully Automated Corn Dog System", "MM-750 Fifteen Sack Batter Mixer", "KW-2001 High-Speed Skewering System", "FC-950 Funnel Cake Fryer and Batter Dispensing System", "AFS Premium Wood Skewers"], "volume": "Corn dog systems: 3,000\u201316,000 units/hour; Kebab systems: up to 4,080 units/hour; Food pumps: up to 223 GPM (844 LPM)", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["World''s first automa