UPDATE companies SET description='Automotive Equipment of Nevada (AEN) operates from Las Vegas, Nevada.

AEN functions as a full-service distributor of automotive shop equipment, representing manufacturers. Its offerings span individual items such as jacks and alignment systems up to complete frame-pulling bays. Beyond sales, the firm provides design services for ground-up dealership construction and major remodels, coordinating with general contractors early to prevent costly change orders. A service division with over 20 years of repair experience handles everything from stuck lifts to leaking oil lines, while an installation team fits equipment ranging from single oil reels to dealerships with more than 80 in-ground lifts.

AEN’s work includes outfitting new dealership builds and supporting remodels for existing service centers.

The company emphasizes a single-source model: because it installs what it sells, it asserts that all components work together harmoniously. Nevada contractor licenses 86133 and 86134 underscore its compliance with state regulations for construction-related installations.', certifications=ARRAY['NV Contractor License 86133','NV Contractor License 86134']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Automotive shop equipment sales", "Dealership design and project coordination", "Automotive equipment repair and maintenance", "Automotive equipment installation", "General contractor coordination"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Automotive dealerships", "Automotive repair shops", "General contracting"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Single-source sales, design, service, and installation of automotive shop equipment", "Early coordination with general contractors to avoid change orders on dealership projects", "Over 20 years of experience repairing all types of automotive shop equipment", "Installation capability from single oil reels to dealerships with 80+ in-ground lifts", "Holds Nevada contractor licenses 86133 and 86134"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2006 -> db", "Headquarters Las Vegas, NV -> db", "Over 34 years serving automotive industry -> /", "Full-service automotive shop equipment distributor -> /", "Services: sales, design, service, install -> /", "NV Contractor License Numbers 86133 & 86134 -> /", "Over 20 years experience repairing equipment -> /", "Install entire dealership with over 80 in-ground lifts -> /", "Coordinate with general contractors to avoid change orders -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We are a full-service automotive shop equipment distributor, selling and servicing the top-tier automotive shop equipment brands.", "founded_year": "2006", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages"