UPDATE companies SET description='B J Plastic Molding Co Inc has operated from Franklin Park, Illinois since its founding in 1968. facilities.

Services include custom imprinting, hot stamping, pad printing (including UPC bar codes), die cutting for information cards that extend through the box hinges, and on-site color and process consultation. All products are designed, created, manufactured, and decorated in the United States.

The company serves customers who need rigid plastic packaging for retail display, offering boxes that allow products to be shown on racks without blister packaging. Its reusable and recyclable boxes are positioned as an alternative to single-use clamshells, providing a container the consumer can keep after the product is used.

