UPDATE companies SET description='B & M Sheet Metal Shop, Inc. has been a family-owned fixture in Roanoke, Virginia since 1955. The company was founded by Wallace Leedy Martin, Edith Martin, and Marion Bartley, later run for decades by Wallace Lee Martin and now led by Luke McVey Martin.

