UPDATE companies SET description='BES Concession Supply, operating as BES Incorporated, was founded in 2002 in Windfall, Indiana, as a family-owned business serving the concession-stand market. The company has remained a community staple for over two decades, and in 2022 the next generation assumed leadership, continuing the original mission while introducing new ideas.

