UPDATE companies SET description='Bad Idea Factory is based in Grand Rapids, Michigan, where it runs a workshop centered on a 5-foot-by-10-foot computer numerically controlled (CNC) machine. The facility also includes a full woodshop, a welding lab, and a 3D printing lab, allowing the team to blend digital fabrication with traditional woodworking and metalworking.

